{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（2日）下午1時26分，牛池灣扎山道381號對開發生交通意外。警方接報，德望小學暨幼稚園（幼稚園部）有2輛校巴相撞，校巴男司機、9名學童、1名保姆及3名職員均有受傷，由救護員逐一檢查。警方正調查事故成因。</p><figure><img alt=\"警車駛入德望學校了解事件。（陳浩然攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171821820504969216924013.jpeg/kFQtvMs9gFlGqacuTIkIXfxDm_9Xzqgac6cRY1anEWM\"/><figcaption>警車駛入德望學校了解事件。（陳浩然攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救援人員到場治理。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171821181578383360695831.jpeg/soFf1v6B3vDJ79xlMNvC4bhZnptQ6XYEQGmx6EBpseg\"/><figcaption>救援人員到場治理。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救援人員到場治理。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171821179451740160602795.jpeg/HSVzAGm1fucwnbBGAmZ4B9bmf-Nd73DJVvjGQVb4xkE\"/><figcaption>救援人員到場治理。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T06:24:00.867831+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}